  {section %title=Introduction
    {references %title=Reference %id=R
{ref %id=SMP %edition=2 March 2020 %ref=ECSS-E-ST-40-07C %href=https://ecss.nl/standard/ecss-e-st-40-07c-simulation-modelling-platform-2-march-2020/ %%Simulation Modelling Platform (SMP)}
